<title>USA: McGehee SD 17, Ark., won by 1st Commercial.</title>
<headline>McGehee SD 17, Ark., won by 1st Commercial.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1st Commercial Trust Co., said it won $3.400 million of McGehee SD 17, Ark., limited tax refunding bonds, with a net interest cost of 5.0397 percent.</p>
</text>
